# `.initiat/setup.yml` Reference — v1.1a (Local Execution)

> Declarative specification for initializing a development environment using the Initiat CLI.
> Designed for **local execution** — assumes you are already in the repository root and that a checked-in setup file exists at `.initiat/setup.yml`.

