## Anti-Patterns

🚫 Hard-coding secret values.
🚫 Writing `.env` files with secrets committed.
🚫 Using `sudo` in arbitrary `run` commands.
🚫 OS-specific logic without `if: os("…")`.
🚫 Non-idempotent shell scripts.

---

