## CLI Behavior Summary

| Command                           | Function                               |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `initiat setup validate`          | Validate YAML and schema correctness   |
| `initiat setup run`               | Execute all phases sequentially        |
| `initiat setup run --phase setup` | Run up to specified phase              |
| `initiat secrets list`            | Show secrets available in this project |

**Executor guarantees**

* Idempotent `ensure_*` actions
* Strict schema validation
* Redacted secrets in logs
* Early exit on first blocking failure
* JSONL + human-readable output

